00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:17.760
right away.

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:18.640
Painting.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:19.840
What?

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.120
The auction is tomorrow.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.520
What?

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:25.480
Wait, stop!

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.200
